05.gif?t=1744383636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679660/extras/TRAV-Feature_Banner-experience_EN.png?t=1744383636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every aspect of the game has been created to deliver a one-of-a-kind experience, from the painted art style to each layer of music. Traveler\u2019s voice is provided by multi-genre artist Essenger, with additional voiceover provided by talented metal artists, representing the broad variety and sheer talent of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679660/extras/TRAV_Steam_GIF_10.gif?t=1744383636\" /></p>","developers":["Red Essence Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679660/header.jpg?t=1744383636","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Red Essence Games & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124585,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124585/movie480.mp4?t=1744383543","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124585/movie_max.mp4?t=1744383543"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124585/411afbceb418686a1f703e9763469bfc694c090f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744383543","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile